quran[13]{c,v,t}:
  35,45,"If Allah were to punish people (at once) for what they have earned, He would not have left a single living being on earth. But He grants them respite till a specified term. And when their time arrives, Allah is All-Seeing of (every action of) His servants."
  36,1,Ya-Sin.
  36,2,"By the Wise Qur’an,"
  36,3,"you are indeed one of the messengers,"
  36,4,upon the straight path.
  36,5,"(This is a revelation) sent down gradually from the All-Mighty, the All-Merciful,"
  36,6,"so that you may warn a people whose ancestors were not warned, so they are heedless."
  36,7,"The Word has already proved true against most of them, but they do not believe."
  36,8,"We have put iron shackles around their necks, which (reach) up to (their) chins. So their heads are turned up."
  36,9,"We have placed a barrier before them and a barrier behind them, and then We have veiled them so they do not see."
  36,10,"It is the same for them: whether you warn them or do not warn them, they will not believe."
  36,11,You (can) only warn the one who follows the Reminder and fears the Most-Compassionate (Lord) without seeing Him. So give him the glad tidings of forgiveness and a generous reward.
  36,12,"Indeed, it is We Who revive the dead and write down what they have sent forth and their effects (which they have left behind). We have counted everything in a clear Record."
